 <div class="w">
 <div>
 <span class="tag">Pendaftaran &amp; Rekrutmen</span>
 <h1>Kirim Lamaran ke ARTEMA</h1>
 <p>Mulai langkah karir Anda bersama PT. ARTEMA PHARMA. Kami mengundang para saintis, apoteker, dan talenta muda berbakat.</p>
 </div>
 </div>
</div>

<div class="w">
 <div class="g" style="grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(320px,1fr));gap:32px">
 
 <!-- Formulir Aplikasi -->
 <div class="c" style="padding:28px">
 <h2 style="margin-top:0;font-size:20px">Formulir Pendaftaran Kandidat</h2>
 <p style="font-size:14px;color:var(--mu)">Isi data diri dan posisi yang diminati. Tim Human Capital kami akan segera meninjau profil Anda.</p>
 
 <div class="fm" style="margin-top:18px">
 <div>
 <label style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700">Nama Lengkap &amp; Gelar:</label>
 <input id="lNama" placeholder="Contoh: apt. Farhan Pratama, S.Farm.">
 </div>

 <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px">
 <div>
 <label style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700">Email Aktif:</label>
 <input id="lEmail" type="email" placeholder="nama@email.com">
 </div>
 <div>
 <label style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700">No. WhatsApp / HP:</label>
 <input id="lHp" placeholder="08xxxxxxxxxx">
 </div>
 </div>

 <div>
 <label style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700">Universitas / Asal Institusi &amp; Jurusan:</label>
 <input id="lKampus" placeholder="Contoh: Farmasi Universitas Sriwijaya">
 </div>

 <div>
 <label style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700">Jalur Pendaftaran:</label>
 <select id="lJalur">
 <option>Program Magang Mahasiswa (1-3 Bulan)</option>
 <option>Praktik Kerja Profesi Apoteker (PKPA Industri)</option>
 <option>Fresh Graduate Development Program</option>
 <option>Tenaga Teknis Kefarmasian (TTK) / Analis Laboratorium</option>
 <option>Apoteker Penanggung Jawab (QA/QC/Produksi)</option>
 <option>Professional / Experienced Staff</option>
 </select>
 </div>

 <div>
 <label style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700">Pilihan Divisi yang Dituju:</label>
 <select id="lDivisi">
 <option>R&amp;D &amp; Formulasi Fitokimia</option>
 <option>Quality Control (QC Lab)</option>
 <option>Quality Assurance (QA Mutu)</option>
 <option>Produksi &amp; Manufaktur CPOB</option>
 <option>Regulatory Affairs &amp; Registrasi BPOM</option>
 <option>PPIC &amp; Manajemen Rantai Pasok</option>
 <option>Marketing &amp; Medical Communication</option>
 <option>Human Capital, GA &amp; IT</option>
 </select>
 </div>

 <div>
 <label style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700">Tautan Berkas CV / Portofolio (Google Drive / LinkedIn):</label>
 <input id="lDrive" placeholder="https://drive.google.com/... atau https://linkedin.com/in/...">
 <small style="color:var(--mu);font-size:11px">Pastikan izin akses tautan Google Drive telah disetel menjadi "Siapa saja yang memiliki link".</small>
 </div>

 <div>
 <label style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700">Surat Motivasi / Catatan Singkat:</label>
 <textarea id="lPesan" rows="3" placeholder="Ceritakan motivasi dan ketertarikan Anda bergabung di ARTEMA..."></textarea>
 </div>

 <button class="btn b1" onclick="sendLamaran()" style="margin-top:10px;width:100%">Kirim Berkas Lamaran &larr;’</button>
 <p id="lStatus" style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700;margin-top:8px"></p>
 </div>
 </div>

 <!-- Info Alur & Kontak HR -->
 <div>
 <div class="c" style="margin-bottom:20px">
 <h3 style="margin-top:0">Tahapan Alur Seleksi:</h3>
 <div class="flow" style="flex-direction:column;gap:12px;margin-top:14px">
 <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start">
 <span style="display:inline-grid;place-items:center;width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--p);color:#fff;font-weight:700;shrink:0">1</span>
 <div><b>Registrasi Berkas:</b> Pengisian formulir online dan pengecekan CV portofolio.</div>
 </div>
 <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start">
 <span style="display:inline-grid;place-items:center;width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--p);color:#fff;font-weight:700;shrink:0">2</span>
 <div><b>Screening Kualifikasi:</b> Penilaian kecocokan latar belakang oleh tim Human Capital.</div>
 </div>
 <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start">
 <span style="display:inline-grid;place-items:center;width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--p);color:#fff;font-weight:700;shrink:0">3</span>
 <div><b>Wawancara Teknis:</b> Diskusi bersama User / Kepala Laboratorium / Apoteker.</div>
 </div>
 <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start">
 <span style="display:inline-grid;place-items:center;width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--p);color:#fff;font-weight:700;shrink:0">4</span>
 <div><b>Medical Check Up:</b> Pemeriksaan kesehatan berkala bebas kontaminan lab.</div>
 </div>
 <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start">
 <span style="display:inline-grid;place-items:center;width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:#3E6B27;color:#fff;font-weight:700;shrink:0">5</span>
 <div><b>Offering &amp; Onboarding:</b> Penawaran resmi dan orientasi CPOB terpadu.</div>
 </div>
 </div>
 </div>

 <div class="c" style="background:var(--lav)">
 <h3 style="margin-top:0">Kontak Human Capital:</h3>
 <p style="font-size:14px;color:var(--tx);margin:8px 0">
 <i data-lucide="mail" class="w-4 h-4 text-pu inline mr-1"></i> Email: <a href="mailto:recruitment@artemapharma.example">recruitment@artemapharma.example</a><br>
 <i data-lucide="phone" class="w-4 h-4 text-pu inline mr-1"></i> Telepon: (0711) 000-000 (Ext. 204 HR)<br>
 <i data-lucide="clock" class="w-4 h-4 text-pu inline mr-1"></i> Jam Kerja: Senin&rdquo;“Jumat, 08.00&rdquo;“16.00 WIB
 </p>
 <p class="note" style="margin-bottom:0"><i data-lucide="alert-triangle" class="w-4 h-4 text-amber-500 inline mr-1"></i> PT. ARTEMA PHARMA tidak memungut biaya apa pun dalam seluruh proses rekrutmen dan seleksi magang.</p>
 </div>
 </div>

 </div>

 <div style="margin-top:40px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between">
